    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1031">

                <pb facs="0780" n="704" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg704"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.48/3353</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Garrett to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Laredo, Texas</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-07-22T09:00:00-06:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 22, 1916, 9 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Sent messenger yesterday morning to bring out Chamal colonists. Two persons
                    arrived here from colony this morning and informed me there were about 85
                    colonists hiding in mountains, about 50 of them women and children.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Garrett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
